msgctxt "548"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "569"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "579"
msgid "Order"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "585"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "606"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "638"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "673"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "701"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "721"
msgid "Okay. That'll be %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "742"
msgid ""
"This is a blunt weapon designed for self-defense, but\n"
"I wouldn't try using it in a brawl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"Not a very powerful weapon, but it's compact and\n"
"easy to hide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "895"
msgid ""
"A knife used by military personnel. Its blade is \n"
"extremely sharp, so don't cut yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "985"
msgid "I'm sure you know all about this handy little weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1039"
msgid ""
"I don't need to explain how this works, do I? It's\n"
"designed for self-defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1117"
msgid ""
"These are normally used for kendo practice, but they\n"
"still pack a punch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1190"
msgid "The next generation in self-defense technology."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1238"
msgid "Has more of a kick than the normal stun gun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1283"
msgid ""
"The street brawler's weapons of choice. Put them on\n"
"your fists to increase the power of your punches."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1385"
msgid ""
"Collapsible and easy to store in a purse or jacket\n"
"pocket. It's good for blocking low attacks, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1485"
msgid ""
"The tips are Kamiyama Works extensions. Some\n"
"customers like the weight distributed this way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1578"
msgid ""
"Supposed to be construction materials, not weapons,\n"
"but they can mess someone up all the same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1673"
msgid ""
"This blade is unmarked, but it's a tried-and-true \n"
"sword made of quality steel. It won't do you wrong. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1777"
msgid ""
"That's a double action revolver. That means pulling \n"
"the trigger both cocks the hammer and fires the gun.\n"
"Well worth the price."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1905"
msgid "Pretty much your garden-variety shotgun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1946"
msgid "Can protect you against some lighter attacks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1992"
msgid "Will really help psych you up before a fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2038"
msgid ""
"Only for those who truly understand the dangers of \n"
"the business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2104"
msgid ""
"Actually just an iron grill pounded into this shape. It's \n"
"heavy as hell, but it'll stop bullets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2202"
msgid ""
"This light-weight breastplate protects against bullets \n"
"and can be worn under a suit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2288"
msgid ""
"These metallic gauntlets can be used to block \n"
"bladed weapons, giving you some protection from\n"
"them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2389"
msgid ""
"So new, it doesn't even have an official name. It's \n"
"strong enough to stop even high-calibur bullets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2491"
msgid ""
"This resin is extremely strong and can be used as \n"
"sealant for a variety of applications, especially \n"
"weapon modification."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2614"
msgid ""
"This spring is made of a special alloy that gives it \n"
"superb durability. It's very springy, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2711"
msgid ""
"This is an old suspension. It's old but made of strong \n"
"metal. My business associate at Kamiyama Works\n"
"brought it over."
msgstr ""